<section class="padding-x-md-60 padd-btm-reset hide-sticky-pricebar">
    <div class="container">
        <h3 class="h-custom h-custom-24--36 small-margin text-center-sm">The subscription includes</h3>
        <p class="h-custom-16--15 small-margin text-center-sm">applies to all subscription plans</p>
        <div class="shadow-medium-3 no-shadow-xs box-radius ov-hidden-md  col-lg-10 col-padding-reset auto-left-right sh-no-hidden">
            <div class="accordion acc-mobile-desktop" id="accFee">
                <div class="acc-item acc-check">
                    <div class="" id="accFeeHeadingOne">
                        <h2 class="collapsing-header">
                            <a href="#accFeeCollapseOne" data-toggle="collapse" aria-expanded="true" aria-controls="accFeeCollapseOne">
                                <strong>Unlimited integrations</strong>
                                <span class="arrow-toggle"></span>
                                <span class="bs-icon bs-icon-check bs-icon-check-blue"></span>
                            </a>
                        </h2>
                    </div>
                    <div id="accFeeCollapseOne" class="collapse show box-radius accordion-content" aria-labelledby="accFeeHeadingOne" data-parent="#accFee">
                        <ul>
<li>over 2000 e-commerce integrations (including marketplace platforms, online stores, carriers and many more)</li>
<li>access to all integrations from one panel without having to log in to each account separately</li>
<li>ability to integrate any number of systems in any configuration</li>
<li>all integrations available during the free trial period and then at subscription price (does not apply to wholesale integrations outside of Base Connect)</li>
<li>no restrictions to the number of accounts connected even within the same marketplace or carrier</li>
</ul>
<a href="/en-US/integrations/" target="_blank">See the range of integrations Base.com has to offer</a>                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="acc-item acc-check">
                    <div id="accFeeHeadingTwo">
                        <h2 class="collapsing-header">
                            <a href="#accFeeCollapseTwo" data-toggle="collapse" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="accFeeCollapseTwo">
                                <strong>Marketplace Manager</strong>
                                <span class="arrow-toggle"></span>
                                <span class="bs-icon bs-icon-check bs-icon-check-blue"></span>
                            </a>
                        </h2>
                    </div>
                    <div id="accFeeCollapseTwo" class="box-radius collapse accordion-content" aria-labelledby="accFeeHeadingTwo" data-parent="#accFee">
                        <ul>
<li>list products from any warehouse (store, wholesaler, ERP or Base.com warehouse)</li>
<li>quick listing tools (including parameter auto-fill, offer templates, shipping templates and category links)</li>
<li>list product variants </li>
<li>bulk operations on multiple offers at the same time</li>
<li>forward orders from marketplace to store and ERP</li>
<li>automatic stock synchronization between marketplace platforms and product warehouse</li>
<li>ability to automatically close out of stock offers</li>
<li>automatic offer price synchronization with prices in the main warehouse</li>
<li>ability to automatically close zero-price offers</li>
</ul>
<a href="/en-US/functions/marketplace-manager/" target="_blank">Explore the other functions of the Marketplace Manager </a>                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="acc-item acc-check">
                    <div id="accFeeHeadingThree">
                        <h2 class="collapsing-header">
                            <a href="#accFeeCollapseThree" data-toggle="collapse" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="accFeeCollapseThree">
                                <strong>Order Manager</strong>
                                <span class="arrow-toggle"></span>
                                <span class="bs-icon bs-icon-check bs-icon-check-blue"></span>
                            </a>
                        </h2>
                    </div>
                    <div id="accFeeCollapseThree" class="box-radius collapse accordion-content" aria-labelledby="accFeeHeadingThree" data-parent="#accFee">
                        <ul>
<li>managing orders from marketplaces, stores, placed by phone or in person</li>
<li>fast order processing thanks to automatic actions</li>
<li>automatic forwarding of dropshipping orders (for wholesalers)</li>
<li>ability to forward orders to the store and ERP</li>
<li>Pick&Pack Assistant support (packing error warnings, taking photo of the shipment)</li>
<li>shipping packages (one by one, in bulk, automatically)</li>
<li>issuing invoices, proforma's, corrections and receipts as well as forwarding to online accounting systems</li>
<li>automatic email and SMS notifications to customers and a unique order information page</li>
<li>phone app displaying orders for the calling customer</li>
</ul>
<a href="/en-US/functions/orders-manager/" target="_blank">Explore the other Order Manager functions </a>                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="acc-item acc-check">
                    <div id="accFeeHeadingFour">
                        <h2 class="collapsing-header">
                            <a href="#accFeeCollapseFour" data-toggle="collapse" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="accFeeCollapseFour">
                                <strong>Shipping management</strong>
                                <span class="arrow-toggle"></span>
                                <span class="bs-icon bs-icon-check bs-icon-check-blue"></span>
                            </a>
                        </h2>
                    </div>
                    <div id="accFeeCollapseFour" class="box-radius collapse accordion-content" aria-labelledby="accFeeHeadingFour" data-parent="#accFee">
                        <ul>
<li>instant access to multiple courier integrations</li>
<li>shipping packages (one by one, in bulk, automatically)</li>
<li>ordering a pick-up</li>
<li>forwarding tracking number to the marketplace and store</li>
<li>automatic printouts of the shipping labels and shipping manifest</li>
<li>customer updates on shipping number and package status</li>
<li>ability to create your own shipment size and weight templates</li>
<li>ability to monitor shipment statuses, delivery time, and each package's history</li>
<li>automatic verification of package delivery</li>
</ul>
<a href="/en-US/functions/shipping-management/" target="_blank">Explore the other benefits of Base.com shipping management</a>                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="acc-item acc-check">
                    <div id="accFeeHeadingFive">
                        <h2 class="collapsing-header">
                            <a href="#accFeeCollapseFive" data-toggle="collapse" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="accFeeCollapseFive">
                                <strong>Workflow automation</strong>
                                <span class="arrow-toggle"></span>
                                <span class="bs-icon bs-icon-check bs-icon-check-blue"></span>
                            </a>
                        </h2>
                    </div>
                    <div id="accFeeCollapseFive" class="box-radius collapse accordion-content" aria-labelledby="accFeeHeadingFive" data-parent="#accFee">
                        <ul>
<li>unlimited number of automatic actions, e.g. in status changes, issuing invoices, sending parcels, customer correspondence</li>
<li>Pick&Pack Assistant support - use a barcode scanner for product picking and parcel packing</li>
<li>fast printing of documents and shipping labels without the need to download files</li>
<li>trigger system actions with a keyboard shortcut, custom button or by scanning the barcode</li>
<li>information on the status of customer orders visible on the phone screen as soon as the caller's number is displayed (with Base Caller app)</li>
</ul>
<a href="/en-US/functions/workflow-automation/" target="_blank">Find out how to automate your business</a>                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="acc-item acc-check">
                    <div id="accFeeHeadingSix">
                        <h2 class="collapsing-header">
                            <a href="#accFeeCollapseSix" data-toggle="collapse" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="accFeeCollapseSix">
                                <strong>Product warehouse</strong>
                                <span class="arrow-toggle"></span>
                                <span class="bs-icon bs-icon-check bs-icon-check-blue"></span>
                            </a>
                        </h2>
                    </div>
                    <div id="accFeeCollapseSix" class="box-radius collapse accordion-content" aria-labelledby="accFeeHeadingSix" data-parent="#accFee">
                        <ul>
<li>ability to create custom product database in the Base.com system (designed for retailers without a store)</li>
<li>ability to add an additional product catalogue from an online storefront (designed for store owners)</li>
<li>quick product listing to marketplaces directly from Base.com's warehouse</li>
<li>stock and price synchronization between warehouse and marketplace services</li>
<li>multiple ways to import products into warehouse: manually, by importing XML, or CSV files, or by creating products directly in the warehouse</li>
<li>ability to quickly export data using predefined templates or custom templates formats with selected content</li>
</ul>
<a href="/en-US/functions/product-manager/" target="_blank">Find out more about the capabilities of Base.com Warehouse</a>                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="acc-item acc-check">
                    <div id="accFeeHeadingSeven">
                        <h2 class="collapsing-header">
                            <a href="#accFeeCollapseSeven" data-toggle="collapse" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="accFeeCollapseSeven">
                                <strong>Online access from any device</strong>
                                <span class="arrow-toggle"></span>
                                <span class="bs-icon bs-icon-check bs-icon-check-blue"></span>
                            </a>
                        </h2>
                    </div>
                    <div id="accFeeCollapseSeven" class="box-radius collapse accordion-content" aria-labelledby="accFeeHeadingSeven" data-parent="#accFee">
                        <ul>
<li>Base.com runs in a web browser - you can run the system on any device with Internet access</li>
<li>seamless access to cloud-based data</li>
<li>data security - backups created twice a day</li>
</ul>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="acc-item acc-check">
                    <div id="accFeeHeadingEight">
                        <h2 class="collapsing-header">
                            <a href="#accFeeCollapseEight" data-toggle="collapse" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="accFeeCollapseEight">
                                <strong>Team profiles</strong>
                                <span class="arrow-toggle"></span>
                                <span class="bs-icon bs-icon-check bs-icon-check-blue"></span>
                            </a>
                        </h2>
                    </div>
                    <div id="accFeeCollapseEight" class="box-radius collapse accordion-content" aria-labelledby="accFeeHeadingEight" data-parent="#accFee">
                        <ul>
<li>employee profiles with separate logins and passwords</li>
<li>ability to define user privileges and access areas</li>
<li>verification of actions performed by employees</li>
<li>ability to create automatic actions with user-specific conditions</li>
<li>employee efficiency tracking</li>
<li>ability to set a different panel language version for each employee</li>
</ul>
                    </div>
