<section class="faq-section hide-sticky-pricebar">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="col-lg-8 auto-left-right">
            <div class="padding-x-md-60 padding-x-xl-83 padding-revise col-padding-reset-sm">
                <h6 class="h-custom h-custom-24--32 h-mobile-28 text-center-sm">Frequently Asked Questions</h6>
                <div class="accordion acc-desktop padding-x-30 padd-btm-reset" id="accFAQ">
                    <div class="acc-item">
                        <div class="" id="accFAQheadingOne">
                            <h4 class="collapsing-header">
                                <a href="#accFAQcollapseOne" role="button" data-toggle="collapse" aria-expanded="true" aria-controls="accFAQcollapseOne">
                                    <strong>Can I try the system before buying it?</strong>
                                    <span class="arrow-toggle"></span>
                                </a>
                            </h4>
                        </div>
                        <div id="accFAQcollapseOne" class="collapse show box-radius accordion-content" aria-labelledby="accFAQheadingOne" data-parent="#accFAQ">
                            <p> Before you decide to buy our services, you can test the program without any obligations for 14 days. The system is fully functional during the test period. </p>                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="acc-item">
                        <div id="accFAQheadingTwo">
                            <h4 class="collapsing-header">
                                <a href="#accFAQcollapseTwo" data-toggle="collapse" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="accFAQcollapseTwo">
                                    <strong>Can I change the subscription plan I am using?</strong>
                                    <span class="arrow-toggle"></span>
                                </a>
                            </h4>
                        </div>
                        <div id="accFAQcollapseTwo" class="box-radius collapse accordion-content" aria-labelledby="accFAQheadingTwo" data-parent="#accFAQ">
                            <p> You can change your plan from Freemium to Business or from Business to Enterprise. Other plan changes are not possible. </p>                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="acc-item">
                        <div id="accFAQheadingThree">
                            <h4 class="collapsing-header">
                                <a href="#accFAQcollapseThree" data-toggle="collapse" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="accFAQcollapseThree">
                                    <strong>Can I choose whether I am on the Business plan or the Enterprise plan?</strong>
                                    <span class="arrow-toggle"></span>
                                </a>
                            </h4>
                        </div>
                        <div id="accFAQcollapseThree" class="box-radius collapse accordion-content" aria-labelledby="accFAQheadingThree" data-parent="#accFAQ">
                            <p>Once you qualify for the Enterprise plan you will be contacted by our team, and to continue to use Base.com, you must switch to a dedicated Enterprise plan.</p>                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="acc-item">
                        <div id="accFAQheadingFour">
                            <h4 class="collapsing-header">
                                <a href="#accFAQcollapseFour" data-toggle="collapse" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="accFAQcollapseFour">
                                    <strong>When do I need to switch to the Enterprise plan?</strong>
                                    <span class="arrow-toggle"></span>
                                </a>
                            </h4>
                        </div>
                        <div id="accFAQcollapseFour" class="box-radius collapse accordion-content" aria-labelledby="accFAQheadingFour" data-parent="#accFAQ">
                            <p> Our Enterprise team will contact you when the scale of your business qualifies you for the Enterprise plan.</p>                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="acc-item">
                        <div id="accFAQheadingFive">
                            <h4 class="collapsing-header">
                                <a href="#accFAQcollapseFive" data-toggle="collapse" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="accFAQcollapseFive">
                                    <strong>Can I use the Enterprise plan when my number of orders and GMV are lower than indicated in the Enterprise plan?</strong>
                                    <span class="arrow-toggle"></span>
                                </a>
                            </h4>
                        </div>
                        <div id="accFAQcollapseFive" class="box-radius collapse accordion-content" aria-labelledby="accFAQheadingFive" data-parent="#accFAQ">
                            <p>Yes. To do so, schedule a call with our enterprise team using <a href="https://form.jotform.com/baselinker/en-US" target="_blank" class="primary-strong">this link</a>.</p>                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="acc-item">
                        <div id="accFAQheadingSix">
                            <h4 class="collapsing-header">
                                <a href="#accFAQcollapseSix" data-toggle="collapse" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="accFAQcollapseSix">
                                    <strong>If I have multiple Base.com accounts, do the volumes add up to determine if I qualify for the Enterprise plan?</strong>
                                    <span class="arrow-toggle"></span>
                                </a>
                            </h4>
                        </div>
                        <div id="accFAQcollapseSix" class="box-radius collapse accordion-content" aria-labelledby="accFAQheadingSix" data-parent="#accFAQ">
                            <p>Yes, in a situation where you manage your business using multiple accounts, we take into account the aggregated volumes from all accounts to qualify for the Enterprise plan.</p>                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="acc-item">
                        <div id="accFAQheadingSeven">
                            <h4 class="collapsing-header">
                                <a href="#accFAQcollapseSeven" data-toggle="collapse" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="accFAQcollapseSeven">
                                    <strong>Do you issue VAT invoices?</strong>
                                    <span class="arrow-toggle"></span>
                                </a>
                            </h4>
                        </div>
                        <div id="accFAQcollapseSeven" class="box-radius collapse accordion-content" aria-labelledby="accFAQheadingSeven" data-parent="#accFAQ">
                            <p>Yes, we issue VAT invoices. Subscription for using the system and payment details are described in the <a href="/en-US/pricing/" target="_blank" class="primary-strong">pricing section</a>.</p>                        </div>
                    </div>
