                "@type": "Answer",
                "text": " You can change your plan from Freemium to Business or from Business to Enterprise. Other plan changes are not possible. "
            }
        },
        {
            "@type": "Question",
            "name": "Can I choose whether I am on the Business plan or the Enterprise plan?",
            "acceptedAnswer": {
                "@type": "Answer",
                "text": "Once you qualify for the Enterprise plan you will be contacted by our team, and to continue to use Base.com, you must switch to a dedicated Enterprise plan."
            }
        },
        {
            "@type": "Question",
            "name": "When do I need to switch to the Enterprise plan?",
            "acceptedAnswer": {
                "@type": "Answer",
                "text": " Our Enterprise team will contact you when the scale of your business qualifies you for the Enterprise plan."
            }
        },
        {
            "@type": "Question",
            "name": "Can I use the Enterprise plan when my number of orders and GMV are lower than indicated in the Enterprise plan?",
            "acceptedAnswer": {
                "@type": "Answer",
                "text": "Yes. To do so, schedule a call with our enterprise team using this link."
            }
        },
        {
            "@type": "Question",
            "name": "If I have multiple Base.com accounts, do the volumes add up to determine if I qualify for the Enterprise plan?",
            "acceptedAnswer": {
                "@type": "Answer",
                "text": "Yes, in a situation where you manage your business using multiple accounts, we take into account the aggregated volumes from all accounts to qualify for the Enterprise plan."
            }
        },
        {
            "@type": "Question",
            "name": "Do you issue VAT invoices?",
            "acceptedAnswer": {
                "@type": "Answer",
                "text": "Yes, we issue VAT invoices. Subscription for using the system and payment details are described in the pricing section."
            }
        }
    ]
}                    </script>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
